# Expense Tracker

Local-first macOS app: Gmail alerts → parse → classify → dashboard at `http://127.0.0.1:8477`.

## Stack

Python FastAPI + SQLAlchemy/SQLite backend; React/Vite/TS frontend in `web/` served from `web/dist`.

## Must preserve

- Axis income only when channel ref ends in `/Sala` (or `/Salary`); other Axis credits are not income
- Salary pay period: credit after day 2 → next month; days 1–2 → current month
- Income metrics use `transaction_type == "income"` only
- Gmail OAuth PKCE `code_verifier` must survive start→callback (Keychain pending)
- Redirect URI: `http://127.0.0.1:8477/oauth/callback`

## After changes

- Tests: `pytest`
- UI: `cd web && npm run build` then restart server/launchd
- No secrets in git

See `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` for full memory.
